{{ 'vesper-legal.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

{% render 'vesper-page-hero',
   title: 'Warranty Policy',
   subtitle: 'Coverage, claims and local support',
   breadcrumb: 'Warranty Policy' %}

<section class="v-section v-section--tight v-legal">
  <div class="v-container v-legal__grid">
    <aside class="v-legal__toc">
      <h3 class="v-legal__toc-title">Contents</h3>
      <ul class="v-legal__toc-list">
        <li><a href="#provider">1. Who Provides This Warranty</a></li>
        <li><a href="#consumer-law">2. Australian Consumer Law</a></li>
        <li><a href="#who-is-covered">3. Who Is Covered</a></li>
        <li><a href="#warranty-period">4. Warranty Period</a></li>
        <li><a href="#what-is-covered">5. What Is Covered</a></li>
        <li><a href="#what-is-not-covered">6. What Is Not Covered</a></li>
        <li><a href="#make-a-claim">7. How to Make a Claim</a></li>
        <li><a href="#what-we-will-do">8. What We Will Do</a></li>
        <li><a href="#costs">9. Costs</a></li>
        <li><a href="#local-support">10. Local Support</a></li>
      </ul>
    </aside>

    <div class="v-legal__main">
      <div id="provider" class="v-legal__block">
        <h2>1. Who Provides This Warranty</h2>
        <p>
          This warranty is provided by <strong>Vesper Robot Mowers Pty. Ltd.</strong> (ABN 71702120143),
          3 Read Street, Templestowe VIC 3106, phone +61 448 290 926, email
          <a href="mailto:info@vesperrobot.au">info@vesperrobot.au</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div id="consumer-law" class="v-legal__block">
        <h2>2. Australian Consumer Law</h2>
        <p>
          Our goods come with guarantees that cannot be excluded under the Australian Consumer Law. You are entitled to
          a replacement or refund for a major failure and compensation for any other reasonably foreseeable loss or
          damage. You are also entitled to have the goods repaired or replaced if the goods fail to be of acceptable
          quality and the failure does not amount to a major failure. This warranty is in addition to, and does not
          limit, your rights under the Australian Consumer Law.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div id="who-is-covered" class="v-legal__block">
        <h2>3. Who Is Covered</h2>
        <p>The original consumer who bought the product from Vesper or an authorised reseller in Australia.</p>
      </div>

      <div id="warranty-period" class="v-legal__block">
        <h2>4. Warranty Period</h2>
        <p>
          Robot mowers: 3 years. Accessories: 12 months. The warranty period starts on the date of delivery.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div id="what-is-covered" class="v-legal__block">
        <h2>5. What Is Covered</h2>
        <p>
          Defects in materials and workmanship under normal consumer use, including internal hardware failures,
          software faults caused by factory defects, and defective original accessories.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div id="what-is-not-covered" class="v-legal__block">
        <h2>6. What Is Not Covered</h2>
        <p>
          Normal wear and tear (such as blades dulling or the battery ageing over time); damage from misuse, neglect or
          accidents; damage from unauthorised repairs, modifications or third-party accessories; and water damage to
          products not rated for water resistance. This does not limit your rights under the Australian Consumer Law.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div id="make-a-claim" class="v-legal__block">
        <h2>7. How to Make a Claim</h2>
        <ol>
          <li>Contact us by email, phone or our <a href="/pages/contact">contact form</a>.</li>
          <li>Send your proof of purchase and a detailed description of the fault. Photos or videos help us process your claim faster.</li>
          <li>Our technical team will assess your claim. If the product must be sent back for inspection or repair, we will give you a return authorisation (RMA) number and instructions.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div id="what-we-will-do" class="v-legal__block">
        <h2>8. What We Will Do</h2>
        <p>
          If your claim is valid and made within the warranty period, we will, at our discretion, repair the product
          using new or refurbished parts, replace it with a new or equivalent refurbished product, or give you a full
          or partial refund if repair or replacement is not possible.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div id="costs" class="v-legal__block">
        <h2>9. Costs</h2>
        <p>If your claim is accepted, we pay the reasonable cost of sending the product to us and returning it to you.</p>
      </div>

      <div id="local-support" class="v-legal__block">
        <h2>10. Local Support</h2>
        <p>Customers in Melbourne East can arrange an inspection at our showroom or at home.</p>

        <div class="v-legal__contact">
          <p><strong>Vesper Robot Mowers Pty. Ltd.</strong></p>
          <p>📧 Email: <a href="mailto:info@vesperrobot.au">info@vesperrobot.au</a></p>
          <p>📞 Phone: +61 448 290 926</p>
          <p>📍 Address: 3 Read Street, Templestowe VIC 3106, Australia</p>
          <a class="v-btn v-btn--primary" href="/pages/contact">Contact Us</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

